        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TB\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% USERS\n%% ==========================\n\nA[\&quot;Business User&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Uploads company knowledge&lt;br/&gt;Documents and information\&quot;]\n\n\nB[\&quot;Knowledge Management Interface&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Dashboard&lt;br/&gt;File upload&lt;br/&gt;Knowledge base settings\&quot;]\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% INGESTION\n%% ==========================\n\nC[\&quot;Document Ingestion Pipeline&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Receives uploaded files&lt;br/&gt;PDF, DOCX, TXT, CSV\&quot;]\n\n\nD[\&quot;Document Processing&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Text extraction&lt;br/&gt;Cleaning&lt;br/&gt;Normalization\&quot;]\n\n\nE[\&quot;Metadata Processing&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Tenant ID&lt;br/&gt;Document ID&lt;br/&gt;Permissions&lt;br/&gt;Tags\&quot;]\n\n\nF[\&quot;Chunking Engine&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Splits documents into smaller sections&lt;br/&gt;Optimized for retrieval\&quot;]\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% EMBEDDINGS\n%% ==========================\n\nG[\&quot;Embedding Generation&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Embedding Models&lt;br/&gt;Convert text into vectors\&quot;]\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% STORAGE\n%% ==========================\n\nH[\&quot;Vector Database&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;pgvector / Redis Vector Search&lt;br/&gt;Stores embeddings\&quot;]\n\n\nI[\&quot;Document Storage&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Original files&lt;br/&gt;Object storage\&quot;]\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% RETRIEVAL\n%% ==========================\n\nJ[\&quot;RAG Retrieval Service&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Semantic search&lt;br/&gt;Similarity matching&lt;br/&gt;Context selection\&quot;]\n\n\nK[\&quot;Context Builder&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Combines retrieved information&lt;br/&gt;Creates LLM prompt context\&quot;]\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% AGENT\n%% ==========================\n\nL[\&quot;Agent Runtime&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;LangGraph Agent&lt;br/&gt;Requests